en:
//【雄飛】
<voice name='雄飛' class='雄飛' src='voice/ma01/0170820b56'>
//「うーん……どこぞの忍者屋敷だってんなら
//ともかく、ただの竹林ですし。ここは」
"Hmm. Maybe if this were an ancient castle or something, but it's just a bamboo grove."

pt:
//【雄飛】
<voice name='雄飛' class='雄飛' src='voice/ma01/0170820b56'>
